WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.110
Bread dough rises.

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:06.070
A sprinter's legs ache and
tire at the end of a race.

3
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.170
A plant sits in the dark at midnight.

4
00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.470
Three very different scenes.

5
00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.030
Yet one process links all three.

6
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.330
What could it be?

7
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:19.110
And in the dark, does the
plant just switch off?

8
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:22.530
In this mission, you'll meet
two kinds of this process:

9
00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.090
one that uses oxygen, and
one that works without it.

10
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.990
You'll see what yeast makes,
and what tired muscles make.

11
00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.970
Then you'll follow energy
along a food chain.

12
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:37.130
Your mission: find the one
process that links all three.
